%% aoneahsan-cccs-react-components — full flow
flowchart TD
    trigger([Building or reviewing a component]) --> age{What kind of project?}

    age -->|existing, on<br/>Radix or ShadCN| keep[KEEP the library.<br/>Use its components — not raw<br/>button/input/select.<br/>Do NOT migrate unprompted]
    age -->|new project| custom[Tailwind latest + CUSTOM components]
    age -->|deliberate UI redo| custom

    custom --> criteria{Does the custom component deliver<br/>ALL of what the library gave?}
    criteria --> c1[Theme management]
    c1 --> c2[Colour management]
    c2 --> c3[Font + typography control]
    c3 --> c4[Contrast management]
    c4 --> c5[Accessibility: keyboard, ARIA, focus]
    c5 --> criteriaok{All six satisfied?}
    criteriaok -->|no| fixcriteria[Not shippable yet —<br/>these are acceptance criteria,<br/>not extras]
    fixcriteria --> criteria
    criteriaok -->|yes| kind

    keep --> kind
    kind{What is the component?}

    kind -->|options: checkbox,<br/>radio or select| count{How many options?}
    count -->|8 or fewer| cards[CARD UI: option-specific SVG icon +<br/>title + one-line description.<br/>Selected state unmistakable]
    cards --> dense{Dense form?}
    dense -->|yes| tight[Tight variant: icon left, label right,<br/>no description]
    dense -->|no| cardsok[Full cards]
    count -->|more than 8| list[Vertical scrollable list,<br/>icon left + label right, or a select.<br/>Cards become overwhelming]

    kind -->|chart| d3[D3.js ONLY.<br/>No Recharts/Chart.js/Victory/Nivo —<br/>wrappers eventually block the design]

    kind -->|anything else| dup{Has this markup<br/>appeared before?}
    dup -->|first time| inline[Write it in place —<br/>do not abstract yet]
    dup -->|second time| together{Will BOTH copies always<br/>change together?}
    together -->|yes| extract[Extract to components/ui/]
    together -->|no| leavedup[Leave the duplication.<br/>Visually similar often diverges]

    tight --> props
    cardsok --> props
    list --> props
    d3 --> props
    inline --> props
    extract --> props
    leavedup --> props
    props[Named props, never positional —<br/>prop names ARE the public API]
    props --> done([Responsive 320-1920, light + dark,<br/>then gates])

    classDef gateNode fill:#fff4e6,stroke:#d97706,color:#7c2d12
    classDef terminal fill:#ecfdf5,stroke:#059669,color:#064e3b
    class age,criteria,criteriaok,kind,count,dense,dup,together gateNode
    class trigger,done terminal
